--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: EventsTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-EN
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f41eb82e28cab9843b74ac44052905fb, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1730823741440
    m_Localized: Your squad has stumbled upon a minefield. Stopping in place, you
      realize one wrong step could cost every man his life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730895044608
    m_Localized: One of the soldiers notices a ten-year-old German girl hiding behind
      a tree. After speaking to her, he reports that she is lost, and her village
      is nearby. He asks permission to escort her back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238912
    m_Localized: "You come across a river with a fast current and a narrow log bridge.
      Crossing seems dangerous, but it\u2019s the only way forward"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238913
    m_Localized: "Your soldiers find a forest patch full of mushrooms and berries.
      It\u2019s a chance to resupply, but there\u2019s a risk they might be poisonous"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238914
    m_Localized: "Your squad discovers a German village. It\u2019s quiet, but it\u2019s
      unclear if any Germans remain. It could have food and supplies, but it might
      also be a trap"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238915
    m_Localized: "One of your soldiers has been very nervous for days, constantly
      keeping his weapon ready. Tonight, it\u2019s his turn for watch duty"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238916
    m_Localized: Heavy rain falls without stopping, turning the trail into thick
      mud that makes every step a struggle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238917
    m_Localized: A sudden chill strikes at night, leaving your soldiers shivering.
      You must decide how to keep them warm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238918
    m_Localized: One of your comrades becomes very ill with fever. A soldier claims
      to know the right herbs, but they must be found
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238919
    m_Localized: Thick fog covers the forest, and you soon realize several soldiers
      are missing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238920
    m_Localized: "You find an unguarded Nazi ammo depot. A soldier suggests setting
      traps as a \u201Cfarewell gift.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238921
    m_Localized: Without maps or compass for too long, your soldiers start arguing
      over the location and which way to go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238922
    m_Localized: One of the soldiers stumbles and breaks his leg. You must decide
      whether to leave him or carry him forward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238923
    m_Localized: A swampy area suddenly appears ahead. One wrong step, and you could
      sink or drown in the bog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238924
    m_Localized: "In the distance, you see a Nazi camp full of supplies and soldiers.
      It\u2019s a chance to resupply, but attacking could result in heavy losses"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238925
    m_Localized: "Nazi planes roar overhead, and soon the sound of bombing begins.
      They might not be aiming at you, but it\u2019s uncertain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238926
    m_Localized: In the distance, barking grows louder, closing in fast. Nazi dogs
      are about to reach your squad. Time is running out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238927
    m_Localized: You see a fire spreading in the forest. The flames are still far,
      but dry trees could ignite quickly, cutting off your path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238928
    m_Localized: Your squad reaches a village and sees Nazis burning a house. Screams
      come from inside. You must act quickly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238929
    m_Localized: A group of terrified civilians runs out of the forest, fleeing from
      the Nazis. They beg for help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238930
    m_Localized: Your squad accidentally steps onto the territory of wild boars.
      Sensing a threat, the animals react aggressively, defending their den. The
      tension rises, and the slightest move could trigger an attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238931
    m_Localized: "Your path leads to a road lined with crosses bearing crucified
      people. It\u2019s a horrific sight"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238932
    m_Localized: You find an abandoned farm in the forest. It could be a place to
      rest and gather supplies, but it might also be a trap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238933
    m_Localized: You come across a wounded Nazi soldier, shivering and begging for
      mercy. What will you do with an enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238934
    m_Localized: "Nazi snipers are hiding at the forest\u2019s edge. You realize
      this when they suddenly fire at fleeing people. Do you take a detour or risk
      breaking through?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238935
    m_Localized: At dawn, a thick fog blankets the forest, hiding everything and
      making movement difficult. You must avoid getting lost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238936
    m_Localized: On the way, you meet a group of Soviet saboteurs who propose a joint
      raid on a Nazi outpost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238937
    m_Localized: "Suddenly, signal flares light up the forest. Decide whether to
      take cover or investigate what\u2019s happening"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238938
    m_Localized: On the way, you meet a woman with a small child begging you to help
      her hide from the Nazis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238939
    m_Localized: One of your soldiers begins acting suspiciously, staying behind
      the group and even caught trying to escape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238940
    m_Localized: Your squad finds a field with a ravine, littered with bodies, including
      fallen comrades. One soldier suggests giving them a final tribute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238941
    m_Localized: You find a hidden tent with a radio transmitter. This could be your
      chance to contact allies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238942
    m_Localized: Your squad has noticed that supplies are disappearing faster than
      expected. and you must find the thief fast before open conflict begins and
      you start starving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238943
    m_Localized: Your best friend Misha offers to sacrifice himself to delay the
      Nazis. He promises to catch up with you once things get too dangerous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238944
    m_Localized: "One of the soldiers realizes he lost his mother\u2019s cross, something
      very dear to him. He asks to stop and search for it"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238945
    m_Localized: In the forest, your squad finds a half-submerged Nazi tank, abandoned
      by its crew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238946
    m_Localized: "While crossing a river, gunfire starts, but you can\u2019t see
      where it\u2019s coming from"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238947
    m_Localized: In the forest, you find a crate dropped by parachute, containing
      fake Nazi documents and uniforms, likely for saboteurs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238948
    m_Localized: During a firefight with the Nazi, you capture several soldiers.
      Your squad argues over what to do with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238949
    m_Localized: "You see two Nazi vehicles stopped on the road. Soldiers from the
      first vehicle order prisoners out of the second. In that moment, you realize
      they\u2019re about to execute them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238950
    m_Localized: Cross the minefield carefully, stepping exactly where the person
      ahead steps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238951
    m_Localized: Take a detour around the minefield; it will slow you down but could
      save lives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238952
    m_Localized: Throw grenades to trigger the mines from a safe distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238953
    m_Localized: Leave the girl behind, deciding not to take on unnecessary risks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238954
    m_Localized: "Kill the girl\u2014it\u2019s too risky if a patrol finds her"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238955
    m_Localized: Allow the soldier to escort the girl to her village; even in war,
      humanity must be preserved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238956
    m_Localized: Try to swim across the river, battling the strong current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238957
    m_Localized: Cross the slippery log carefully, one at a time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238958
    m_Localized: Walk along the river to find a safer crossing for the entire squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238959
    m_Localized: Gather berries and mushrooms to replenish critical supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238960
    m_Localized: Avoid gathering berries and mushrooms to prevent poisoning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238961
    m_Localized: Collect berries and mushrooms, testing them on a volunteer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238962
    m_Localized: Wait for nightfall to pass through the village and gather supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238963
    m_Localized: Avoid the village to reduce the risk of encountering locals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238964
    m_Localized: Gather supplies and prepare to defend yourselves if resistance arises
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238965
    m_Localized: Rotate the soldier out and give him time to rest and recover
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238966
    m_Localized: "Leave the nervous soldier on watch\u2014his vigilance might save
      the squad"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238967
    m_Localized: Disarm the soldier to prevent an accidental shot revealing your
      position
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238968
    m_Localized: Take shelter from the rain and wait for it to pass before moving
      on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238969
    m_Localized: "Keep moving through the mud and cold, maintaining the squad\u2019s
      pace"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238970
    m_Localized: Search for an alternate route to avoid unnecessary hardship for
      the squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238971
    m_Localized: Build a large fire to warm up, despite the risks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238972
    m_Localized: Insulate the campsite with dry leaves, spruce branches, and other
      materials
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238973
    m_Localized: Start a small fire and have a hearty meal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238974
    m_Localized: Leave the sick soldier behind, knowing a delay risks the entire
      group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238975
    m_Localized: Send soldiers to search for medicinal herbs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238976
    m_Localized: Craft a stretcher for him and take him along, hoping his condition
      improves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238977
    m_Localized: Stop and set up camp while searching for the missing soldiers nearby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238978
    m_Localized: Move forward, understanding that the squad cannot afford delays
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238979
    m_Localized: Shout for your comrades, and if that fails, fire a few shots into
      the air
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238980
    m_Localized: Set up traps and withdraw, leaving an unpleasant surprise for the
      enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238981
    m_Localized: Avoid the depot to stay unnoticed and keep the squad safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238982
    m_Localized: Set up an ambush, turning the depot into a defensive position
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238983
    m_Localized: Set up camp and send out scouts in different directions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238984
    m_Localized: Stick to the planned route, staying together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238985
    m_Localized: Climb to a high point or a tree to look for landmarks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238986
    m_Localized: Make splints for him and continue the journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238987
    m_Localized: "Leave him with supplies and move on; we can\u2019t afford delays"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238988
    m_Localized: Shoot the soldier; better us than him falling to the Nazi, and we
      need the supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238989
    m_Localized: Find a detour to avoid risking lives and supplies in the swamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238990
    m_Localized: Take the risk and cross the swamp carefully, watching every step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238991
    m_Localized: Drop some supplies, tie a rope from cloth, and move carefully as
      a group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238992
    m_Localized: Wait for night, steal supplies, and retreat under the cover of darkness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238993
    m_Localized: Circle around the Nazi camp to avoid endangering the squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238994
    m_Localized: Wait for nightfall and attack the camp, seizing the supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238995
    m_Localized: Find shelter in the forest to avoid the bombing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238996
    m_Localized: Keep moving, maintaining distance between soldiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238997
    m_Localized: Open fire on the enemy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238998
    m_Localized: Take defensive positions and fight back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899238999
    m_Localized: Run!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239000
    m_Localized: Sacrifice one soldier to save the rest of the squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239001
    m_Localized: "Move along the fire; we don\u2019t have time for other maneuvers"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239002
    m_Localized: Look for shelter in pits, water, or other safe spots away from the
      fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239003
    m_Localized: Move against the wind to avoid the fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239004
    m_Localized: Search other houses to gather more supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239005
    m_Localized: Avoid this small settlement to keep the squad safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239006
    m_Localized: Eliminate the Nazis and rescue the people without delay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239007
    m_Localized: Take the civilians with you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239008
    m_Localized: Leave the civilians behind, realizing they could complicate things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239009
    m_Localized: Share supplies with them and point them to a safe route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239010
    m_Localized: Try to scare off the boars with loud noises
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239011
    m_Localized: Carefully retreat, leaving some supplies behind as a distraction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239012
    m_Localized: Open fire on the boars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239013
    m_Localized: Take the people down from the crosses and bury them with respect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239014
    m_Localized: Avoid this area, fearing an ambush
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239015
    m_Localized: Scout the area, then take the fallen down from the crosses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239016
    m_Localized: Search the farm and gather supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239017
    m_Localized: Continue on your way without wasting time on exploration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239018
    m_Localized: Surround the farm and wait for nightfall to approach it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239019
    m_Localized: Help the wounded Nazi soldier, remembering that we are all human
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239020
    m_Localized: Leave him behind and move on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239021
    m_Localized: "Kill him; it\u2019s too dangerous to leave him alive for the patrol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239022
    m_Localized: Wait for nightfall and quietly bypass the snipers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239023
    m_Localized: Fire at the snipers to force them to reveal their positions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239024
    m_Localized: Sacrifice one soldier to distract the enemy and pass unnoticed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239025
    m_Localized: Stay together and keep moving to avoid losing anyone in the fog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239026
    m_Localized: Wait for the fog to clear to avoid unnecessary losses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239027
    m_Localized: Send a soldier up the tallest tree to find a landmark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239028
    m_Localized: Accept the offer to raid the enemy post together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239029
    m_Localized: Decline the raid and continue on your way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239030
    m_Localized: Trade supplies for information about Nazi patrols
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239031
    m_Localized: Take defensive positions, preparing the squad for any potential
      threat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239032
    m_Localized: Keep moving, hoping the signal flares are not related to us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239033
    m_Localized: Send a scout to investigate the situation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239034
    m_Localized: Take the woman and her child into the squad and help them hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239035
    m_Localized: Order to kill the woman to ensure the squad remains undiscovered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239036
    m_Localized: Interrogate the woman about enemy positions, then leave her behind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239037
    m_Localized: Punish the soldier for attempting to desert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239038
    m_Localized: Let the soldier go with supplies; deserters have no place here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239039
    m_Localized: Remind the soldier of his duty to the squad and bring him back in
      line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239040
    m_Localized: Throw the bodies into a ravine and bury them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239041
    m_Localized: "Leave this place; we don\u2019t have time for this"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239042
    m_Localized: Bury the bodies and hold a short ceremony to honor the fallen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239043
    m_Localized: Search the tent and use the radio transmitter to contact allies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239044
    m_Localized: Search the tent and destroy the radio transmitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239045
    m_Localized: Leave the tent and transmitter untouched and move on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239046
    m_Localized: "Check everyone\u2019s bags and execute the thief"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239047
    m_Localized: Gather the squad and remind them that you are one unit; if supplies
      run out, everyone will have to take risks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239048
    m_Localized: "Check everyone\u2019s bags and exile the thief"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239049
    m_Localized: "Allow your friend to stay behind and delay the Nazis, trusting
      his courage for the squad\u2019s sake"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239050
    m_Localized: Order your friend to stay with the squad, not allowing unnecessary
      sacrifices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239051
    m_Localized: Let your friend delay the Nazis, but send another soldier to keep
      watch over him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239052
    m_Localized: "Convince the soldier there\u2019s no time to search and order the
      squad to move on"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239053
    m_Localized: Order the squad to split up and search quickly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239054
    m_Localized: 'Give the soldier a choice: continue with the squad or stay behind
      to search for the cross'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239055
    m_Localized: Repair the tank and use it to break through enemy lines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239056
    m_Localized: Move on without taking the risk; the tank might be booby-trapped
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239057
    m_Localized: Search the tank for supplies and weapons, then continue forward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239058
    m_Localized: Order the squad to take cover and wait for the enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239059
    m_Localized: Push forward across the river under fire as quickly as possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239060
    m_Localized: Retreat and look for an alternative route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239061
    m_Localized: Take everything; it might come in handy later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239062
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t touch the crate\u2014if it\u2019s for our scouts, any
      interference could jeopardize the mission"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239063
    m_Localized: Wait for the saboteurs and ask for their help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239064
    m_Localized: Order the prisoners to be tied up and brought along
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239065
    m_Localized: Execute the prisoners; no mercy for the enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239066
    m_Localized: Let the soldiers decide their fate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239067
    m_Localized: "Open fire immediately to save the prisoners before it\u2019s too
      late"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239068
    m_Localized: Command the squad to flank the enemy and attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239069
    m_Localized: Wait for the Nazis to finish and then cross the road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239070
    m_Localized: We crossed the minefield step by step, but explosions took the lives
      of several comrades. Nazi patrol will likely believe the squad was completely
      destroyed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239071
    m_Localized: Crossing the minefield took longer than expected due to its vast
      size
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239072
    m_Localized: "Some mines didn\u2019t detonate immediately but exploded when stepped
      on later"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239073
    m_Localized: You left the girl and continued on. One soldier was deeply upset.
      Later, you heard her screams in the distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239074
    m_Localized: A soldier argued against saving the girl, calling everyone fascists.
      He was silenced, and the order was carried out. Later, locals found her body
      and now seek revenge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239075
    m_Localized: A returning soldier reported that the Nazi, grateful for saving
      their daughter, gave him a basket of food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239076
    m_Localized: Due to the strong current, several soldiers had to discard their
      gear to cross
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239077
    m_Localized: Crossing the log bridge was harder than it seemed. One soldier lost
      his balance and was swept away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239078
    m_Localized: "The river\u2019s current remained strong as you moved upstream.
      Eventually, you found a calmer spot to cross, but you lost much time and energy"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239079
    m_Localized: The foraged berries and mushrooms were edible. The soldiers felt
      relief and enjoyed a brief respite from hunger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239080
    m_Localized: Some of the group are displeased, as they were sure some of the
      food was unsafe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239081
    m_Localized: One soldier refused some mushrooms and berries, but the ones he
      tried were safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239082
    m_Localized: At night, you quietly passed through a village, collecting supplies.
      By morning, someone will surely notice the missing goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239083
    m_Localized: You bypassed the village, spending much more time to avoid attracting
      local attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239084
    m_Localized: While gathering supplies, one soldier was attacked by an old man.
      In fear or anger, the soldiers opened fire on the locals. Now, the village
      is deserted
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239085
    m_Localized: "One soldier was sure someone was watching for us but followed orders.
      By morning, you found two comrades with their throats torn out \u2014 wolves
      had no mercy"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239086
    m_Localized: 'At night, you heard a shot. The squad sprang up and saw a dead
      wolf and a soldier standing over it: "I told you, we were being watched"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239087
    m_Localized: That night, you woke up to screams near your camp. Running towards
      the noise, you found a dead sentry and the bodies of three wolves. He sensed
      the danger after all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239088
    m_Localized: You decided to wait for the day, knowing the patrols have also stopped
      their search due to the weather, and by morning, all tracks would be washed
      away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239089
    m_Localized: The road was difficult, and your soldiers kept falling. However,
      you managed to finish the route, though many supplies were lost along the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239090
    m_Localized: The search for a new route took longer than expected, but eventually,
      you found the right path and continued forward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239091
    m_Localized: The fire warmed the soldiers, but someone must have noticed it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239092
    m_Localized: Without a fire, the soldiers froze, and one did not wake up in the
      morning. Your decision spared the squad from detection, but at what cost?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239093
    m_Localized: The fire and hot food warmed the soldiers, and in the morning, you
      continued your journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239094
    m_Localized: You left a soldier to die from fever, and after walking some distance,
      you heard a shot. The soldiers were displeased with your decision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239095
    m_Localized: The soldiers found the necessary herbs, guided by a knowledgeable
      comrade. He made a tincture, and the next day, the soldier recovered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239096
    m_Localized: The soldier weakened with each passing hour and died, slowing down
      the squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239097
    m_Localized: In five hours, your group regrouped and continued on
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239098
    m_Localized: You continued in hopes of meeting your soldiers later, but it did
      not happen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239099
    m_Localized: You shouted for your comrades, but the sound echoed through the
      forest, confusing you. Gunshots made a clearer sound, allowing your team to
      reach you, exchanging shots in the sky. But these actions will attract attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239100
    m_Localized: "You found some supplies and set traps to make the explosion look
      like an accident. Unfortunately, you didn\u2019t consider that the blast would
      attract more patrols"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239101
    m_Localized: You decided not to risk your men, as any sabotage would draw attention,
      and theft would not go unnoticed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239102
    m_Localized: You managed to kill a dozen NAzi and take supplies. The explosion
      at the depot attracted patrols, but all traces of your presence burned in the
      fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239103
    m_Localized: The scouts returned, and one found the path to our way home, but
      sadly, one scout was lost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239104
    m_Localized: Soon, you realized by landmarks that you had changed your route.
      You lost a day, and the patrol moved closer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239105
    m_Localized: One soldier skillfully climbed a tree and managed to determine the
      right direction from above
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239106
    m_Localized: The soldiers crafted a stretcher and took turns carrying him. The
      soldier was grateful for not being left behind, but this journey would take
      more time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239107
    m_Localized: Let fate decide his fate, or perhaps he will kill a few Nazi soliers
      with him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239108
    m_Localized: Right now, the life of any soldier on his feet matters more than
      the injured one. We cannot risk the whole squad or waste supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239109
    m_Localized: The detour took time, but the squad stayed intact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239110
    m_Localized: A few soldiers got stuck in the swamp, losing supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239111
    m_Localized: By dropping supplies, your group managed to cross the swamp alive.
      It was tough, and someone was nearly pulled under, but being light helped
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239112
    m_Localized: "Your squad infiltrated the camp and stole some supplies without
      issue, but by morning, Nazi noticed the theft \u2014 now they are hunting for
      you"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239113
    m_Localized: Bypassing the camp was hard, as patrols were everywhere. You spent
      more time than expected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239114
    m_Localized: At night, you crept toward the enemy and began killing sleeping
      Nazi. Though outnumbered, the surprise allowed you to destroy their camp, but
      your squad lost many men
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239115
    m_Localized: Your squad survived by hiding in various locations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239116
    m_Localized: By splitting up, you improved your survival chances, but some shells
      hit two of your soldiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239117
    m_Localized: You opened fire on the planes with rifles, now the Nazi know where
      you are. They fired back with machine guns, killing four soldiers. The planes
      will report your location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239118
    m_Localized: The dogs are killed, but the gunshots and animal bodies will attract
      nearby patrols
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239119
    m_Localized: "Everyone knows dogs always catch up with people, but the order
      was clear \u2014 only the fastest among you will survive"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239120
    m_Localized: The dogs attacked a soldier who fought them fiercely. It was a brutal
      death
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239121
    m_Localized: The fire took the lives of four soldiers, and many supplies burned.
      However, the patrols tracking us will likely stop searching for a while
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239122
    m_Localized: You managed to take cover from the fire, but sadly, a burning tree
      fell into a pit and landed on one of your men. He burned alive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239123
    m_Localized: "The squad supported your decision \u2014 only a madman would walk
      through fire. But now the route to our allies is longer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239124
    m_Localized: "While the Nazi were busy burning a house, you successfully found
      some supplies. But the enemy will notice they\u2019re missing"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239125
    m_Localized: You slipped past unnoticed while the Nazi soldiers were preoccupied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239126
    m_Localized: "You opened fire and, despite being outnumbered, destroyed the enemy
      squad. However, you lost several men. Sadly, no one could be saved \u2014 they
      all burned"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239127
    m_Localized: Your squad grew in size, but supplies are now scarcer. Moreover,
      the Nazi patrol pursuing that group are now after you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239128
    m_Localized: You chose not to risk it and left the civilians behind. This may
      spare the squad from unnecessary trouble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239129
    m_Localized: "You explained that you couldn\u2019t take them with you but gave
      them some supplies. In return, they shared the location of Nazi posts"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239130
    m_Localized: Attempts to scare off the boars only drew their attention. Soon,
      they furiously attacked the squad, and several soldiers fell to the enraged
      beasts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239131
    m_Localized: "You quietly left the boars\u2019 den, avoiding conflict as they
      defended their territory"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239132
    m_Localized: "Rifle shots barely pierced the boars\u2019 thick hides. In the
      furious struggle, several soldiers were wounded, and one was killed. These
      gunshots surely attracted a nearby patrol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239133
    m_Localized: "One man was still alive. You treated his wounds and took him with
      you. The squad\u2019s morale improved, but the patrol will notice and start
      searching for you"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239134
    m_Localized: The squad avoided a possible ambush, but morale dropped from witnessing
      the horror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239135
    m_Localized: Recon allowed you to avoid danger, but you spent a lot of time.
      The patrol will notice your actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239136
    m_Localized: "You found some supplies \u2014 a few potatoes and carrots"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239137
    m_Localized: You chose not to risk it and kept moving. Open ground is too dangerous
      under the threat of enemy fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239138
    m_Localized: "It turned out the farm was abandoned. You found some supplies \u2014
      potatoes and carrots"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239139
    m_Localized: Nazi soldier, surprisingly fluent in Russian, thanked your squad.
      He also pointed out a safer route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239140
    m_Localized: Soon, you realized a patrol was on your trail. That Nazi must have
      survived and revealed your location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239141
    m_Localized: The Nazi soldier realized your intentions and, as two of your soldiers
      approached, detonated a grenade, killing himself
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239142
    m_Localized: Darkness became our cover. We slipped by unnoticed, but lost much
      time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239143
    m_Localized: In the skirmish, your men managed to take out the enemy snipers.
      Sadly, a few of your own fell in the fight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239144
    m_Localized: The sacrifice was not in vain. Private Chistyakov enabled your squad
      to bypass the snipers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239145
    m_Localized: While moving through the fog, one of your soldiers slipped and fell
      down a hill with the supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239146
    m_Localized: You waited out the fog, but the enemy search party is getting closer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239147
    m_Localized: A soldier scouted from above and pointed out a safer path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239148
    m_Localized: The joint raid brought in many supplies, but it cost many lives
      and drew significant attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239149
    m_Localized: "Your squad avoided risks and losses but missed the chance to gather
      supplies. Later, you heard Nazis gunfire \u2014 it seems the saboteurs failed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239150
    m_Localized: The exchange of information reduced danger without unnecessary risk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239151
    m_Localized: You spotted Nazi patrols and had to wait nearly all day to avoid
      confrontation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239152
    m_Localized: The group continued moving but stumbled upon a Nazi patrol, resulting
      in the loss of several soldiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239153
    m_Localized: A scout encountered a Nazi patrol, and you took the opportsquady
      to slip past unnoticed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239154
    m_Localized: The group grew larger, increasing supply consumption. The patrol
      searching for those two may now come across you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239155
    m_Localized: One soldier left the squad, saying he would help them and, if caught,
      would kill them himself to buy as much time as possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239156
    m_Localized: The information gained will help avoid many dangers, but the men
      are unhappy with your decision
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239157
    m_Localized: As a lesson to the others, you executed one of the men, reminding
      everyone that we are soldiers of the Soviet Army, where there is no place for
      cowards or deserters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239158
    m_Localized: "The soldier admitted his cowardice and begged for forgiveness,
      thinking he'd have a better chance of survival alone. The squad was surprised
      by your decision to spare him \u2014 such actions usually mean immediate execution"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239159
    m_Localized: "Begging for forgiveness, the soldier cried out in despair, admitting
      he had become a coward, saying captivity and the Nazi were driving him mad.
      But as a commander, you firmly reminded him who he was \u2014 a Soviet soldier.
      He composed himself and carried on... but for how long?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239160
    m_Localized: "The men threw the bodies into a ravine, understanding why we couldn\u2019t
      bury them separately but instead created a mass grave. The enemy was near,
      leaving no time for ceremonies. Even so, this was better than letting the bodies
      rot and become food for animals"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239161
    m_Localized: Your order upset the men, and they reluctantly left their comrades
      behind. The squad's morale suffered
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239162
    m_Localized: "The men found one soldier unconscious on the field. He\u2019s fine
      now, but we lost much time, and the enemy is closing in"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239163
    m_Localized: You found supplies, but your signal was intercepted by the enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239164
    m_Localized: "You found supplies and destroyed the abandoned radio transmitter.
      However, the men are unhappy \u2014 it could have been used to contact our
      forces"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239165
    m_Localized: You chose not to risk it and passed by the area, avoiding potential
      dangers. Who knows what could have happened there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239166
    m_Localized: During an inspection, you found a soldier with more supplies in
      his bag than he should have. He denied it, made up excuses, and eventually
      started pointing fingers at others. Without hesitation, you carried out a righteous
      execution. Stealing from your comrades is the ultimate sin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239167
    m_Localized: Later, during a rest stop, someone quietly returned the missing
      supplies. It seems survival outweighed the desire to hoard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239168
    m_Localized: "During an inspection, you found a soldier with more supplies in
      his bag than he should have. He shouted it wasn\u2019t him and claimed he was
      framed. You exiled him, leaving him without weapons or supplies \u2014 a thief\u2019s
      fate is to live like a wolf. But later, it turned out he wasn\u2019t the one,
      as the thefts continued"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239169
    m_Localized: Your comrade, showing great courage, stays behind. From a safe distance,
      you hear gunfire and explosions that last for about 20 minutes. When it finally
      stops, you silently say goodbye to a friend who gave his life to save the squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239170
    m_Localized: Your friend followed the order and stayed with the group. Later,
      in private, he reprimanded you for putting duty above friendship
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239171
    m_Localized: As you retreat to a safe distance, you hear 20 minutes of relentless
      gunfire and explosions. Finally, the noise stops. Later, a scout returns and
      reports that your friend successfully led the enemy away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239172
    m_Localized: The soldier is dejected but obeys the order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239173
    m_Localized: You searched for hours, but sadly, he was not found. The soldier
      thanks you for the effort
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239174
    m_Localized: "You couldn\u2019t risk the squad for one soldier. Deep down, you
      hoped he would find the item and return, but it didn\u2019t happen"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239175
    m_Localized: "Your squad repaired the tank, which took some time, and soon you
      rode it straight to the front, smashing through the forest and enemy lines.
      Nothing could stop you \u2014 except the fuel running out"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239176
    m_Localized: You decide against using this risky plan. The tank is too conspicuous,
      and no one would leave it untouched or untrapped
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239177
    m_Localized: The soldiers found some supplies and weapons, replenishing your
      stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239178
    m_Localized: "The squad avoided casualties. Gunfire echoed for a while longer,
      then faded. Perhaps it wasn\u2019t meant for you, but now no one will ever
      know"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239179
    m_Localized: Several of your men were killed in the crossfire, but you reached
      and eliminated the enemy. It was three young enemy deserters who panicked at
      the sight of you and opened fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239180
    m_Localized: You chose to retreat, avoiding casualties. But the patrol is closing
      in, and soon you may be caught between two forces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239181
    m_Localized: The uniforms and documents may prove useful, but it will make life
      harder for our scouts. Sadly, there is no other choice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239182
    m_Localized: You decide not to interfere with the reconnaissance. A Soviet soldier
      always knows that the mission is more important than any one life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239183
    m_Localized: You waited nearly a day, but they still had not arrived. Then, you
      heard enemy voices nearby. Likely a patrol searching for the package. Without
      hesitation, you decided to flee while you still could
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239184
    m_Localized: The prisoners slowed you down, but thanks to them, you managed to
      bypass several enemy checkpoints
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239185
    m_Localized: The soldiers, without hesitation, executed the prisoners. Captivity
      had left us all a little more vengeful
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239186
    m_Localized: The soldiers took it upon themselves to deal with the enemy, using
      whatever they could find. It was not a quick task
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239187
    m_Localized: A sudden attack saved the prisoners. The enemy was few in number.
      One truck tried to escape, but its tires were shot out, causing it to overturn.
      The prisoners joined your squad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239188
    m_Localized: Your men took positions, but it was too late. The prisoners had
      been executed, and the enemy drove away. You decided not to pursue a senseless
      fight. Approaching the bodies, you silently apologized for failing them, but
      you found one survivor, gravely wounded
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239189
    m_Localized: The enemy forced the prisoners to run into the forest, and as soon
      as they reached the trees, automatic gunfire rang out. Soon after, the Nazi
      left in their trucks. Your squad continued onward, holding back its fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239190
    m_Localized: One of the soldiers suggests leaving a false trail to confuse the
      enemy and buy time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239191
    m_Localized: "A soldier proposes a loud distraction\u2014using a grenade trap
      or setting the forest on fire to draw the patrol's attention away"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239192
    m_Localized: "The soldiers suffer from thirst, and one suggests searching for
      a spring or river. But you know it\u2019s slightly off your path"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239193
    m_Localized: "Your group is growing hungrier\u2014supplies are nearly gone, and
      the soldiers' strength is fading with each passing day"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239194
    m_Localized: On the road leading to the front line, there is a Nazi checkpoint
      guarded by armed soldiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239195
    m_Localized: One of the soldiers questions your leadership and urges others to
      take a different course of action
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239196
    m_Localized: Agree and create several false trails
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239197
    m_Localized: "Move faster despite the exhaustion\u2014delays could cost us our
      lives"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239198
    m_Localized: Agree and make more false trails, scattering some supplies along
      the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239199
    m_Localized: Set up a grenade trap triggered by an animal to distract the enemy
      from the squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239200
    m_Localized: Set the forest on fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239201
    m_Localized: Refuse the distraction maneuver as it might draw even more attention
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239202
    m_Localized: Divert from the route and search for water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239203
    m_Localized: Continue moving forward; we will find supplies on the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239204
    m_Localized: Send a small group to search for water and rendezvous at a designated
      location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239205
    m_Localized: Send a few soldiers to hunt; we cannot risk the entire squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239206
    m_Localized: Keep moving forward; we will find supplies along the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239207
    m_Localized: Hunt with the entire squad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239208
    m_Localized: Order the soldiers to attack the checkpoint; we must break through
      this final barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239209
    m_Localized: Search for an alternative route to avoid unnecessary combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239210
    m_Localized: Dress in Nazi uniforms and present forged documents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239211
    m_Localized: Remind the soldiers about the chain of command and order them to
      follow your directives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239212
    m_Localized: Relinquish your command
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239213
    m_Localized: Order the soldier and those who agree with him to go their own way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239214
    m_Localized: The Nazi fall for the decoy and follow the false trail, giving the
      squad time to escape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239215
    m_Localized: In haste, you managed to lose the patrol, but only later did you
      notice one soldier was missing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239216
    m_Localized: The Nazi follow the false trail, allowing the squad to break away
      without losing many supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239217
    m_Localized: The explosion draws the Nazis attention, and the patrol temporarily
      changes their search direction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239218
    m_Localized: The fire distracts the Nazis, forcing them to retreat. However,
      the flames spread faster than expected, becoming a new enemy and claiming two
      of your men
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239219
    m_Localized: The squad continues quietly, avoiding noise. But the Nazis keep
      pursuing, gradually closing the distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239220
    m_Localized: Your squad finds a river, quenches their thirst, and fills up as
      much water as possible for the journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239221
    m_Localized: You decide not to split the squad or deviate from the path. However,
      thirst drives some soldiers to drink from puddles, forcing you to intervene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239222
    m_Localized: The search group finds a river and collects a small amount of water
      to bring back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239223
    m_Localized: The hunting group returns to the squad with game, enough meat to
      feed everyone. Their efforts secure food for a long time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239224
    m_Localized: "Hunting in the forest is too risky. Gunshots might attract patrols,
      and the noise could reveal your location. It\u2019s too dangerous to take the
      chance"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239225
    m_Localized: The soldiers find enough game to feed the whole squad, but the prolonged
      stop allows the Nazi to close the gap significantly. The squad now has food,
      but the patrol is too close, making it hard to avoid conflict
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239226
    m_Localized: The squad successfully captures the checkpoint, but losses are heavy.
      The front is close now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239227
    m_Localized: "The detour takes time; we must conserve supplies\u2014the front
      is near"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239228
    m_Localized: Your squad passes the checkpoint unnoticed. Your knowledge of Nazi
      and forged documents deceive them. You are almost there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239229
    m_Localized: You remind everyone how you drove the enemy from our land, escaped
      captivity, and always emerged victorious despite losses. The squad recalls
      your achievements, apologizes, and you continue the journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239230
    m_Localized: Chaos breaks out in the squad; soldiers split into groups, each
      heading in different directions, leaving you alone with your plans and duties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1730899239231
    m_Localized: The squad splits; the dissatisfied soldiers leave. Now you are fewer,
      but the risk of detection is also lower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1153992744919040
    m_Localized: 'Now you are alone. The soldiers who stood by you have fallen, defeated
      by hunger, cold, and the enemy.


      You knew there was no way back. Hunted
      by the Nazi, you moved forward, carrying the memory of your comrades. In the
      end, your story finished like theirs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1153992803639296
    m_Localized: "At first, the forest felt like a safe place, but it became a deadly
      trap. We ran out of supplies, and every step drained your strength. Soon, it
      was clear \u2014 we couldn\u2019t go on.\nAs their commander, you said with
      pain: 'We did all we could...' One by one, the soldiers fell, too weak from
      hunger and cold. The dark forest took them, and the way back to the front was
      lost forever.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1153992803639297
    m_Localized: "You couldn\u2019t hide anymore. The patrols found you and surrounded
      your group. The fight was short. Your men, tired and wounded, couldn\u2019t
      hold them off.\n\nThe Nazi left, leaving behind the bodies of those who still
      believed they\u2019d make it home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1153992803639298
    m_Localized: "You did it. After surviving the forest, the cold, and hunger, your
      squad reached the front lines \u2014 thanks to you. The soldiers were greeted
      with smiles and hugs from their comrades.\n\nYou were welcomed as heroes, saved
      by a miracle. For the first time in a long while, you allowed yourself to smile.\n\nBut
      there\u2019s no time to rest. In a few days, Major Ryabchikov, you\u2019ll
      take command of a battalion and lead the attack. Your story is just beginning\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
